s></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 时画树状图/列表比套公式快）；</li>\n<li>&quot;至少&quot;型优先<strong>间接法</strong>（总数−反面）；</li>\n<li>二项式求系数和/指定项：代入法 + 通项公式，都是机械操作；</li>\n<li>风险：计数题最容易<strong>重复计数</strong>（分组没除序、分类不互斥），算完用小数据验证。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["计数原理","排列","组合","捆绑法","插空法","二项式定理"],"summary":"计数原理与排列组合 两大原理 分类加法计数原理 ：&quot;要么…要么…&quot;→ 相加（互斥）； 分步乘法计数原理 ：&quot;先…再…&quot;→ 相乘（独立）。 排列与组合 排列： A n m = n ! ( n − m )","fit":[],"updated":"Sun Feb 02 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"math","title":"数学"},{"slug":"statistics","title":"统计与概率"},{"slug":"counting","title":"计数原理与二项式"},{"slug":"counting","title":"计数原理与排列组合"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"barrier-method","title":"隔板法（正整数解/非负整数解）","type":"example"},{"slug":"binding-insertion","title":"排列组合·捆绑法与插空法","type":"example"},{"slug":"binomial-coefficient","title":"二项式展开常数项（指数平衡）","type":"example"},{"slug":"derangement","title":"错位排列·装错信封（全错排）","type":"example"},{"slug":"group-partition","title":"均匀分组问题（除序法）","type":"example"}]}